    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Sylvie Labrosse",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113022738504650367116/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJgkJ1WbgWfU5zMy4qeIfLzBqWSodz34IwavD9Z7CI5vn9lQw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Best cake ever!! Seriously the cakes made by Lyne are a work of art.The look of the cake was unique and classic all at the same time. The flavors of the raspberry-whipped ganache, the Swiss meringue buttercream with white chocolate on the outside and raspberry on the inside, the raspberry compote, the lemon cream and the lacy crepes for more crunch.  All this combination of flavor was as much a delight for the eyes as for the taste buds! I highly recommend!",
        "time": 1717337299,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Roxanne St-louis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101785808693324348536/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKF-natF0__7eTfXFpKTGWnMwj0Z1zUzM5UMct2IGWHGMOxKw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I highly recommend working with Rose Champagne Atelier. The cake for my daughter's christening was simply sublime and delicious—an explosion of flavor in every bite and a work of art to behold. Lyne listens carefully to our needs and inspiration. She created an event that exceeded my expectations.",
        "time": 1719344608,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Catherine Hamelin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117363733426507700554/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLXyiUGMbHB_7qXWwzvv54BNaM9mBACRfDbwBp5h-0tn8cj5g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The cake was my dream for my party! The cake designer was able to realize what I had in mind with my tastes like colors, textures and decorations. The cake was delivered in good condition for my birthday and it contained fresh ingredients. I wanted a heart and the cake designer was able to stand out by offering a cake that stands in the shape of a heart. The flavor was matcha and chocolate, my two favorite flavors and I am really happy that it was possible!",
        "time": 1717353291,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christiane St Louis",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105228884787120963102/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7GZCdpFgofjo1p8vsqi64NeZqhxfGK_6sZwA1QzBQHY_fyZSB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Rose Champagne Atelier created the dream cake for my niece's daughter's christening. It was such a wonderful and magnificent cake that it seemed to have descended from heaven!\n\nAbsolutely delicious, made with high-quality, fresh ingredients!\nThank you to RCA for their professionalism and exceptional talent!",
        "time": 1719810500,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Camille L.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106996131613220966380/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLHlqCQZQUY7dopJvVPJmAIBUnnzWcMdLDFm0iX9QukJ7_PJQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
